<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-OMNI HALF YEAR NET PROFIT UP 21 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-OMNI HALF YEAR NET PROFIT UP 21 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997 (in millions of S$ unless states)</p>
<p>    Net profit			4.35    vs     3.59</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	     1.30    vs     1.20</p>
<p>    Turnover			145.86    vs   110.24</p>
<p>    Other income		    0.51    vs     0.28</p>
<p>    Interest expense		1.03    vs     1.28</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax	     6.08    vs     5.19</p>
<p>    Tax				 1.67    vs     1.48</p>
<p>NOTE - Omni Industries Ltd is a plastics moulding company serving the electronics industry.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65) 8703080; fax (65) 776 8112</p>
<p>--Email: Singapore.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
